  "description": "EVOSER crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C116 H90 Br6 N12 O16 Yb4. From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 7 O neighbors; Yb8 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb3 (Yb) has 7 O neighbors; Yb4 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb79 (Yb) has 7 O neighbors; Yb78 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb7 (Yb) has 7 O neighbors; Yb9 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.474-3.804 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.55-112.79°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C116H90Br6N12O16Yb4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
